<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>{% block title %}IntegrationEngine Demo{% endblock %}</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: sans-serif; background: #f9f9f9; }
        header { background: #333; color: white; padding: 1rem; }
        header h1 { margin: 0; }
        main { max-width: 1200px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
        footer { background: #333; color: white; padding: 1rem; text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem; }
        a { color: #0066cc; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>IntegrationEngine Demo</h1>
    </header>
    <main>
        {% block body %}
        <h2>Welcome to IntegrationEngine Demo</h2>
        <p>A guided tour through external API integrations with TMDB, Stripe, and more.</p>

        <h3>Available Tours:</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="/en/tour/the-problem">The Problem</a> - Why you need IntegrationEngine</li>
            <li><a href="/en/tour/parallel-requests">Parallel Requests</a> - Concurrent API calls</li>
            <li><a href="/en/tour/behind-the-counter">Behind the Counter</a> - Extensibility & Resilience</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Languages:</h3>
        <p>
            <a href="/en/">English</a> |
            <a href="/es/">Español</a>
        </p>
        {% endblock %}
    </main>
    <footer>
        <small>Data provided by <a href="https://www.themoviedb.org/" style="color: #0066cc;">The Movie Database (TMDB)</a></small>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
